        "title": "Name the basis of a judgment",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "State the perspective or evidence between the framing words, then give the judgment it supports. The frame is useful only when that basis matters.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "从时间来看，我们明天去更合适。",
                "pinyin": "cóng shíjiān láikàn ， wǒmen míngtiān qù gèng héshì 。",
                "meaning": "From the standpoint of timing, going tomorrow is more suitable.",
